---
description: Rules for the Expo mobile app (planned, MOB-01 to MOB-07)
globs: apps/mobile/**,packages/ui-native/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- `apps/mobile` and `packages/ui-native` are placeholders. Do not scaffold them unless the issue is a MOB item.
- The app is not built yet (ROADMAP MOB-01); do not scaffold it unless the issue says so.
- Expo Router and NativeWind on `packages/ui` tokens. Use logical layout props so RTL can be added later.
- Tokens in `expo-secure-store` only. The offline event pack is encrypted at rest and wiped 48h after the event.
- The QR scanner must work fully offline against the signed passes the API issues. Queue scans with a client UUID (`ScanEvent.clientUuid`).
